---
// Testing-lane artifact: the sample bug report, trimmed as in
// freelancer_project/content/landing-v3-copy.md §3 (format example on a generic
// app; source applications/samples/bug-report-sample.md). It sits on ground,
// not on the lime field (the field owns one region per viewport, OB-11), so it
// is a hairline sheet without the field card's shadow.
---
<figure class="bug">
  <p class="bug-tag">Format example · generic app, not a client project</p>
  <div class="bug-sheet">
    <p class="bug-meta"><span>Bug</span><span>High severity</span><span>5/5 attempts</span></p>
    <p class="bug-title">“Add to list” returns a server error when the item name has an accent (é, ñ)</p>
    <div class="bug-steps">
      <p class="bug-h">Steps</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Open “My lists” and click “Add to list”.</li>
        <li>Type “Café molido”.</li>
        <li>Click “Save”.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <dl class="bug-kv">
      <div><dt>Expected</dt><dd>The item is saved at the top of the list.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Actual</dt><dd>“Something went wrong”. Not saved. <span class="nowrap">POST /api/items → 500.</span> <span class="mark">Same steps with “Cafe molido” work.</span></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Env</dt><dd>Chrome on Windows (ASUS TUF Gaming F15) · Safari on iPhone 15 Pro Max · Chrome on Xiaomi 12T Pro</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Evidence</dt><dd>Screen recording (0:24) · network tab · console log</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="bug-cap">This is how I write up a bug, whether it came from a customer ticket or a test session: steps, expected and actual result, device, and the detail that narrows down the cause.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bug { margin: 0; max-width: var(--card-max); }
  .bug-tag { font-size: var(--type-label); line-height: var(--leading-small); font-weight: 600; }
  .bug-sheet {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    background: var(--color-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    font-size: var(--type-body-sm);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }
  .bug-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-1) var(--space-4); font-size: var(--type-label); color: var(--color-ink-2); }
  .bug-meta span:first-child { font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-ink); }
  .bug-title { margin-top: var(--space-2); font-weight: 700; font-size: var(--type-subject); line-height: var(--leading-subject); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .bug-steps { margin-top: var(--space-4); padding-top: var(--space-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule); }
  .bug-h { font-size: var(--type-label); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink-2); }
  .bug-steps ol { margin-top: var(--space-1); padding-left: var(--space-5); }
  .bug-kv { margin-top: var(--space-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule); }
  .bug-kv > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: calc(var(--space-9) * 0.75) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-3); padding-top: var(--space-3); }
  .bug-kv dt { font-size: var(--type-label); font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink-2); padding-top: var(--space-1); }
  .bug-kv dd { margin: 0; }
  .bug-cap { margin-top: var(--space-4); font-size: var(--type-label); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); max-width: 58ch; }
  .nowrap { white-space: nowrap; }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .bug-sheet { padding: var(--space-4); }
    .bug-kv > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
  }
</style>
